{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_NVM_SECTION_8_6_1_1_AUTOSAR_NVRAM_Manager_module","src":"manifest","doc":"SWS_COMManager","page":144,"text":"8.6.1.1 AUTOSAR NVRAM Manager module\n[SWS_ComM_00103] Use standardized services of the NVRAM Manager module\nfor storing and reading non-volatile configuration data ⌈The ComM module shall\nuse the corresponding standardized services of the NVRAM Manager module (see\n[SWS_ComM_00828]) for storing and reading non-volatile configuration data:\n• ComMNoWakeup (see [ECUC_ComM_00569] and [SWS_ComM_00157])\n• ComMEcuGroupClassification (see [SWS_ComM_01104])\n• the Inhibit counter (see [SWS_ComM_00140])\n• the PNC-to-channel Mapping (see [SWS_ComM_01040]) and the PNC member-\nship (see [SWS_ComM_01049])\n⌋\nComment: See [SWS_ComM_00864] and [SWS_ComM_00865] when configuration\ndata shall be read and stored\nFor details refer to the AUTOSAR NVRAM Manager module Specification [13].","caption":"8.6.1.1 AUTOSAR NVRAM Manager module","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_NVM_SECTION_8_6_1_1_AUTOSAR_NVRAM_Manager_module","releases":["R23-11"],"page":123,"hash":"ef89343a9e774496","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_NVM_SECTION_8_6_1_1_AUTOSAR_NVRAM_Manager_module","releases":["R24-11"],"page":145,"hash":"cefcdd2c7cf9d02e","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_NVM_SECTION_8_6_1_1_AUTOSAR_NVRAM_Manager_module","releases":["R25-11"],"page":144,"hash":"d6ab76ab20f85316","caption":""}],"releases":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_ComM_00103] im Text von SWS_COMManager.","rel":["R25-11"],"id":"SWS_ComM_00103"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_ComM_00140] im Text von SWS_COMManager.","rel":["R25-11"],"id":"SWS_ComM_00140"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_ComM_00157] im Text von SWS_COMManager.","rel":["R25-11"],